{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人姚子羚（Elaine）在無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》演出備受讚。</p><p>日前，她又為TVB Plus全新訪談節目《我和牠的故事》擔任嘉賓。</p><p>在今晚（19日)節目中，Elaine跟14歲愛犬唐狗阿通一同亮相，她表示自小便喜歡動物，但從未想過會因為一頭狗改</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.636076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.373128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.373128+00:00","content_hash":"844062c16435a47347578ac3b9494be2de677d726771e289e10137be0c8ef0f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}